{
    "title": "Terrible's Social House",
    "description": "With the Terrible's Social House app you get the best of both worlds!\r\nFirst, you get everything Terrible's! Find your nearest location and its amenities with the intuitive store map locator. Discover and enter Terrible\u2019s current deals & promotions. And, through the My Status page, instantly check your status on Terrible's Social House loyalty programs including the new in-store purchase rebate and better-than-ever drink club.\r\nSecond, you get Terrible\u2019s Social House with the excitement of Las Vegas right at home! Play exciting Multi-reel, Multi-line SLOT MACHINES or try your hand at Multi-Hand VIDEO POKER, or have a go with new KENO games! Try the \u201cTerrible\u2019s Wild West\u201d slot with a progressive starting at 1 Billion Coins!\r\n\r\nEarn real in-store REWARDS two ways! Collect Points with every purchase at over 100 Terrible's convenience stores. And, collect Badges through social casino play in-app. Both Points and Badges may be REDEEMED for product discounts at any Terrible's Convenience Store!\r\n\r\nSpin to win! Terrible\u2019s Social Casino is packed with exciting multi-reel, multi-line Slot Machines. Featuring rich bonus games, the slots include Sequential Symbols, Stacked Wilds, Mystery Wilds, Wild Reels, Locked Wilds, Stamped Reels, Symbol Burst, Pick 'Em Games and much more!\r\n\r\nShuffle up and deal! Terrible\u2019s Social House is loaded with 9 multi-hand Video Poker titles -- each with up to 10 hands at the same time! Play the most popular games -- like those in every Las Vegas casino -- Jacks or Better, Bonus Poker, Double Bonus Poker, Double Double Bonus Poker, Triple Double Bonus Poker, Bonus Deluxe Poker, Deuces Wild, Bonus Deuces Wild and even Double Bonus Deuces Wild!\r\n\r\nPick your Keno numbers! Terrible's Social Casino now has 4 new themed Keno Games that will give you a thrilling Keno experience like never before. Choose your Spots playing Terrible's Keno, Herbst Road Rally Keno, Queen of Egypt Keno and Pot-O-Gold Keno, each with Bonus Rounds that are sure to give you something to tell your friends about!\r\n\r\nTERRIBLE\u2019S SOCIAL HOUSE FEATURES:\r\n\r\n\u2022 FREE to play!\r\nStart spinning slots with 2,500,000 FREE COINS as our welcome bonus!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Awesome FREE VIP Club!\r\nGet an extra 2,000,000 FREE COINS and FREE BADGES for joining, plus great REWARDS including Coin Pack specials.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Earn a Badge boost with each Coin Pack!\r\nGet something back! Badges are redeemed for actual stuff in Terrible's Convenience Stores!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Huge Max wagers!\r\nDouble or Triple down on your bet to win a Big, Mega or Giga jackpot!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Generous awards of FREE COINS!\r\nWe give out free coins through timely BONUS and MYSTERY awards ...Wait for it as our free coin timers go off frequently. Play more and you get more Free Coins!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Show off with our LEADERBOARDS.\r\nTop 50 positions for HIGHEST level, BIGGEST trophy, GREATEST win and LARGEST win multiplier, both on Slots and Video Poker!\r\n\r\n\u2022 How big is your Trophy?\r\nEarn a Trophy through in-game achievements, and get rewarded even more!\r\n\r\n\u2022 New slots and cool features\r\nThe party never ends with frequent updates including brand new slots and gameplay!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Level-up for additional rewards\r\nMore FREE COINS with EACH level-up!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Compete and share with friends\r\nCompete with new and old friends alike. Visit their Trophy Rooms!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Stunning HD graphics and animation effects\r\nExperience all the energy, sights and sounds of Vegas!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Developed by veteran Las Vegas slot designers\r\nDesigned by the makers of real-money gambling slot machine hits like Yahtzee\u2122, Clue\u2122, 5th Grader\u2122, Family Feud\u2122 and Ripley's Believe It or Not!\u2122\r\n\r\nDownload the Terrible's Social House app today!\r\n\r\nTerrible\u2019s Social House is an interactive social game app, for amusement only, that simulates casino slot machine gambling. In-app credits cannot be exchanged for real money. Success at a social casino app does not suggest success at real-money gambling. By downloading or playing, you agree to comply with all applicable laws relating to social gaming.",
